### Isi data produk awal (opsional, pengganti input manual di dashboard)
### Langsung ke product-service (port 8091), login sebagai superuser.

@pbUrl = http://192.168.1.104:8091
@suToken = {{su.response.body.$.token}}

### 0. Login superuser
# @name su
POST {{pbUrl}}/api/collections/_superusers/auth-with-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identity": "admin@katalogku.id",
  "password": "GantiPasswordKuat123"
}

### 1. Kemeja Batik Parang
POST {{pbUrl}}/api/collections/products/records
Authorization: {{suToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kemeja Batik Parang",
  "description": "Kemeja batik motif parang, bahan katun.",
  "category": "fashion",
  "price": 25,
  "rating": 4.6,
  "stock": 40,
  "thumbnail": "https://picsum.photos/id/21/300"
}

